1
ORDINANCE NO. ___________
ENTITLED:
“AN ORDINANCE AMENDING SECTION 9.16.100(B), OPEN HOUSE
ASSEMBLY, OF CHAPTER 9.16, OFFENSES BY OR AGAINST MINORS, OF
TITLE 9, PUBLIC PEACE AND WELFARE, OF THE CODE OF THE CITY OF
CHEYENNE, WYOMING, PERTAINING TO THE DEFINITION OF ‘ADULT.’”
BE IT ORDAINED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE CITY OF CHEYENNE,
WYOMING:
Section 1.  That Section 9.16.100(B), Open House Assembly, of Chapter 9.16, Offenses By
or Against Minors, of Title 9, Public Peace and Welfare, of the Code of the City of Cheyenne,
Wyoming, is amended to read as follows:
9.16.100
Open house assembly.
B.
Definitions.  As used in this section, the following terms are defined:
“Adult” means a person twenty-one (21) EIGHTEEN (18) years of age or older.
Section 2.  This ordinance shall be in full force and effect upon approval and publication.
FIRST READING:______________________________________________________________
SECOND READING:____________________________________________________________
THIRD READING:______________________________________________________________
__________________________________________
Richard L. Kaysen, Mayor
(SEAL)
Attest:
____________________________________
Carol Intlekofer, City Clerk
